@anon.0de5ee8f4a9046f07397637c35d34c13.2078 = private unnamed_addr constant [22 x i8] c"surrounding-whitespace", align 1
@anon.0de5ee8f4a9046f07397637c35d34c13.2079 = private unnamed_addr constant [628 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for surrounding whitespace in docstrings.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0ARemove surrounding whitespace from the docstring, for consistency.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Adef factorial(n: int) -> int:\0A    \22\22\22 Return the factorial of n. \22\22\22\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Adef factorial(n: int) -> int:\0A    \22\22\22Return the factorial of n.\22\22\22\0A```\0A\0A## References\0A- [PEP 257 \E2\80\93 Docstring Conventions](https://peps.python.org/pep-0257/)\0A- [NumPy Style Guide](https://numpydoc.readthedocs.io/en/latest/format.html)\0A- [Google Python Style Guide - Docstrings](https://google.github.io/styleguide/pyguide.html#38-comments-and-docstrings)\0A", align 1
