@anon.0de5ee8f4a9046f07397637c35d34c13.2143 = private unnamed_addr constant [289 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for extraneous parentheses.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AExtraneous parentheses are redundant, and can be removed to improve\0Areadability while retaining identical semantics.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Aprint((\22Hello, world\22))\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Aprint(\22Hello, world\22)\0A```\0A", align 1
